e bartender for a bit. The service was good, but it wasn't really packed when I was here, so I don't know how service is when there's a crowd."},{"business_id":"e3Ue5jwrgC62LOG6vyfaLQ","review_id":"hNAPPVfU0c7gK9LM89RlvA","date":"2014-09-13T01:03:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9275257587432861,"text_excerpt":"I like this place. straight up bar, inexpensive, friendly bartender! neighborhood joint, and we happened on service industry night. bonus. after being served crap at a pretentious bar in the quarter, it was nice to just be in A REAL BAR. LOL"},{"business_id":"e3Ue5jwrgC62LOG6vyfaLQ","review_id":"Ubezyg3RYZmJ4iOY4Jw0yg","date":"2012-05-29T23:10:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9145511984825134,"text_excerpt":"I love this bar, seriously. This is definitely my cheers. The staff and regulars are nice and there is always good music on the jukebox. With nightly drink specials and the fact that they close very late, don't be surprised if you spend more time here than you expected. Did I mention I love this bar?"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
